/ActualText (  Key Achievements\nSupported the museum in developing a 5-year employability strategy for local youth and helped secure funding from both government and social sector sources.\n  Core Responsibilities\nActed as a core research contributor in a two-year evaluation \(2023\0232024\) of LTM\031s youth programmes, focusing on skill development among participants aged 18\02326.\nApplied mixed-method research with 20+ participants to assess the effectiveness of 3 core initiatives. Findings showed a 75% increase in youth participation and a 46% rise in satisfaction among youth employees in 2024.\nConducted live UX research at Skills Late, the annual event for Route into Work \(200+ youth\), which attracted DWP interest and laid the groundwork for a planned 2026 scale-up to 400+ attendees.)
