/ActualText (  Key Achievements\nBoosted content creators' satisfaction by 28% by redesigning and implementing innovative features and user flows for the Create function within the app.\n  Core Responsibilities\nCross-functional collaboration with product managers, UX/UI teams, and developers to develop a food-themed social media iOS & Android app.\nCreated high-fidelity wireframes and prototypes with detailed annotations to streamline and enhance cross-team communication efficiency.\nConducted resource-efficient usability testing with 5 target users, applying moderated qualitative methods to identify key user pain points in existing feature Create.)
