/ActualText (, which helped the charity received government 1000\243 sponsorship.\nDesigned a user-centered website for London based Ohisama Sushi Restaurant, which optimised satisfaction among existing customers by 30% and boosted new customer retention rates by 45%.\nBuilt a unified design component library for Wemanage, a California-based hospitality SaaS platform, streamlining design standards across product lines and boosting development efficiency.\nDesigned the book cover for Leadership Reiki, crafting a professional visual identity for a Reiki practitioner and executive coach targeting senior corporate audiences.)
